ehouse environment.\n\u2022 Unloading: Learn best practices for lowering and dropping off packages safely.\n\u2022 Explore: Review a 3D model of a forklift and learn about each component in detail.\n\u2022 Quiz: Take a quiz and put your forklift knowledge to the test.", "short_description": "Everything you need to pass a forklift certification, all in one place. Train to properly operate a forklift in a warehouse environment!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.chalkbites.com/index.php/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ChalkBites, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.chalkbites.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "PRODUCTIVITY", "EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1299128390588086"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4711996772160047"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "4711996772160047"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1623448980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4711996772160047"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6336480763067519", "version": "1.0.12"}, "id": "122671859778295", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename"